<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25</p>
<p>lower. Trading moderately active. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   58.50-59.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   58.00-58.50</p>
<p>Sows in limited number sold steady. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>	    500-550 lbs    48.50</p>
<p>	    550-650 lbs    49.00-49.50</p>
</text>
